{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>內地股市回調。</p><p></p><p>四大指數中，深圳創業板指數跌幅較大，跌約百分之2.6，並以接近全日低位收市。滬深京三市成交1.55萬億元人民幣。</p><p></p><p>算力硬件板塊下跌。風電和光伏股逆市上升。內銀股造好，中國銀行、工商銀行和建設銀行A股創新高。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-12T09:02:50.775400+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":111,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"},"published_at":"2026-10-12T08:21:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-12T11:17:53.933341+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-12T08:57:44.877722+00:00","content_hash":"212db199cda26917c8c902538181055bc10b6ede49d03851f31f5614b4790b2e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null}